Thats the plan, yeah. It should be included like other contrib
stuff, but for now it's not finished. I cannot test all features
by myself nor haven't yet implemented all the stuff i want. But
its great to hear that you like it :)
For now i would like the following 'features' to be implemented:
- - check if config syntax is correct and all what we need set correctly.
(imho very important since atm it relies on 'you know what you're
doing and you're doing it correctly' ;)
- - some examples for hypermail rc files

and maybe:
- - more options on a per list basis (like zip creation)

But i think we should have all mayor needings soon.


| BTW I really like mlmmj, it is very light and awesome. Keep up the
| good work.

Yeah, mlmmj just rocks. No need for qmail anymore ;-)

